<html>
 <head>
  <title></title>
 </head>
 <body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
  <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
              border-collapse:collapse;
              background-color:#ffffff;" width="100%">
   <tbody>
    <tr>
     <td align="center" style="padding:0;">
      <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="max-width:760px;
                              width:100%;
                              background-color:#ffffff;
                              border:2px solid #c9a75d;
                              border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
       <tbody>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:0;"><img alt="Arelia Email Banner Image" src="{[devName:Arelia_Email_Banner_Image]}" style="display:block;
                                           width:100%;
                                           max-width:100%;
                                           height:auto;
                                           border:0;" title="Arelia Email Banner Image" /></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td style="padding:30px 34px 32px 34px;"><p style="margin:0 0 20px 0;
                                          font-size:22px;
                                          line-height:1.4;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#1f1f1f;"><strong>Proforma Invoice Approved</strong></p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Dear <strong>[CLIENT_NAME]</strong>,</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">We are pleased to inform you that the <strong>Proforma Invoice</strong> for your interior project, <strong>[OPPORTUNITY_NAME]</strong>, has been <strong style="color:#2e844a;"> successfully reviewed and approved </strong>.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">The finalized proforma invoice is attached to this email for your reference and records.</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;
                                              margin-bottom:18px;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td style="border-top:1px solid #e3d2a8;
                                                       padding-top:20px;"><p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:20px;
                                                          line-height:1.4;
                                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                                          color:#1f1f1f;"><strong>What happens next?</strong></p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Our team will now proceed with the next stages of your project as per the approved scope and details. If any further information or confirmation is required, our team will reach out to you.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Should you have any questions regarding the invoice or the next steps, please feel free to contact supervisor.</p> <p style="margin:0 0 22px 0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Thank you for your trust in us. We look forward to delivering your project as planned.</p> <p style="margin:0;
                                          font-size:18px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#222222;">Warm regards,<br /> <strong>Arelia Team.</strong></p></td>
        </tr>
        <tr>
         <td align="center" style="background-color:#171717;
                                       border-top:2px solid #C99A3D;
                                       padding:24px 32px 22px 32px;
                                       text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
                                          font-size:24px;
                                          line-height:1.3;
                                          font-family:Times New Roman,Times,serif;
                                          color:#D6B36A;
                                          font-weight:bold;
                                          text-align:center;">Arelia</p> <p style="margin:0 0 18px 0;
                                          font-size:11px;
                                          line-height:1.5;
                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                          color:#C99A3D;
                                          letter-spacing:2px;
                                          text-align:center;">PREMIUM &amp; LUXURY INTERIOR DESIGNS</p>
          <table border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="width:100%;
                                              border-collapse:collapse;" width="100%">
           <tbody>
            <tr>
             <td align="center" style="border-top:1px solid #6E5427;
                                                       padding-top:16px;
                                                       text-align:center;"><p style="margin:0 0 5px 0;
                                                          font-size:11px;
                                                          line-height:1.6;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#8F887F;
                                                          text-align:center;">This email was sent because your Proforma Invoice was approved for your Arelia project.</p> <p style="margin:0;
                                                          font-size:11px;
                                                          line-height:1.6;
                                                          font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;
                                                          color:#8F887F;
                                                          text-align:center;">© 2026 Arelia. All rights reserved.</p></td>
            </tr>
           </tbody>
          </table></td>
        </tr>
       </tbody>
      </table></td>
    </tr>
   </tbody>
  </table>
 </body>
</html>